#%PAM-1.0
# novadeck override of SDDM's autologin PAM stack. The CRITICAL requirement: the session phase must
# run pam_systemd so logind registers this as a real seat0 login session — that (and deck's `wheel`
# membership) is the whole point of routing the shell through SDDM. `system-login`'s session stack
# includes `pam_systemd.so`; we include it here. Auth is bypassed (autologin) via pam_permit.
auth        required    pam_env.so
auth        required    pam_permit.so
account     include     system-login
session     include     system-login
